## Additional Terms for Engineering Software

This Software is designed to generate scripts for ADONIS FEM, a geotechnical 
finite element analysis program. The generated scripts are for PRELIMINARY 
ANALYSIS AND PROTOTYPING ONLY.

THE GENERATED SCRIPTS ARE NOT SUITABLE FOR:
- Final design verification
- Tender design
- Claim assessment
- Safety-critical decisions
- Regulatory submissions

Users MUST consult with qualified geotechnical engineers and use site-specific 
investigation data before applying any generated scripts to professional 
engineering work.

The authors assume no liability for engineering decisions made based on 
scripts generated by this Software.
